    "Tables, task lists, and strikethrough always parse and cannot be turned off. Autolinks are recognised only in <https://…> form, and footnotes are not supported yet. Block directives affect document structure; Preview and exports render their source as ordinary Markdown, without DocC callout styling. An unfinished directive falls back to ordinary Markdown if it would hide content.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Tables, task lists, and strikethrough always parse and cannot be turned off. Autolinks are recognised only in <https://…> form, and footnotes are not supported yet. Block directives affect document structure; Preview and exports render their source as ordinary Markdown, without DocC callout styling. An unfinished directive falls back to ordinary Markdown if it would hide content."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Tables, task lists, and strikethrough always parse and cannot be turned off. Autolinks are recognised only in <https://…> form, and footnotes are not supported yet. Block directives affect document structure; Preview and exports render their source as ordinary Markdown, without DocC callout styling. An unfinished directive falls back to ordinary Markdown if it would hide content."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Tables, task lists, and strikethrough always parse and cannot be turned off. Autolinks are recognised only in <https://…> form, and footnotes are not supported yet. Block directives affect document structure; Preview and exports render their source as ordinary Markdown, without DocC callout styling. An unfinished directive falls back to ordinary Markdown if it would hide content."
          }
        }
      }
    },
